# ==============================================================================
# KATHABRIDGE REAL AUTHENTICATION ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (FIREBASE)
# ==============================================================================
# 
# To enable 100% real Google Sign-In and real Email/Password Authentication:
# 
# 1. Visit the Firebase Console: https://console.firebase.google.com/
# 2. Click "Add project" and name it "KathaBridge" (or your preferred name).
# 3. In the project dashboard, click "Build" > "Authentication" > "Get started".
# 4. Under the "Sign-in method" tab:
#      - Enable "Google" (select your support email and click Save).
#      - Enable "Email/Password" (turn on Email/Password and click Save).
# 5. In Project Settings (gear icon in left sidebar) > "General":
#      - Scroll down to "Your apps", click the Web icon (</>) to register a web app.
#      - Copy your Firebase SDK config values and paste them below:
# 6. For Vercel production deployment:
#      - In your Vercel project dashboard, go to Settings > Environment Variables
#      - Add the exact same VITE_FIREBASE_* variables below.
#      - In Firebase Console > Authentication > Settings > Authorized domains,
#        add your Vercel domain: kathabridge.vercel.app
# 
# ==============================================================================

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_firebase_api_key_here
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project_id.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project_id.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_messaging_sender_id
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_firebase_app_id

